<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h2 data-lake-id="tTwVm" id="tTwVm" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u030174ca" id="u030174ca">⚓ 𝐍-𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐦 𝐄𝐦𝐛𝐞𝐝𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub0762127" id="ub0762127"><strong><span data-lake-id="u54afa9c0" id="u54afa9c0">基于嵌入的记忆机制为模型容量扩展提供一个互补维度。N-gram 嵌入以局部上下文为条件进行记忆检索，而非仅依赖词元标识，从而进一步推广单词元查表机制。具体而言，以每个词元结尾的短 n-gram 序列作为嵌入表的检索键，检索得到的向量用于增强相应的词元表示</span></strong></p><ul list="uea6bc8a0"><li fid="u0ccccf2c" data-lake-id="ucb7d9f8c" id="ucb7d9f8c"><span data-lake-id="uddad2fc6" id="uddad2fc6">N-gram 记忆能够在每个词元新增浮点运算量可忽略的情况下扩展容量，而确定性寻址则支持将嵌入表卸载至主机内存，并进行异步预取。采用多头哈希进行嵌入查表。随后，通过上下文门控机制将这些嵌入注入残差流</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub483a362" id="ub483a362"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3f3852e" id="ue3f3852e" style="color: #5C0036">一个嵌入层已经足够，最终放在第 2 层。实验没有发现某个深度始终最优，将相同参数预算分配到多个嵌入层也没有稳定收益。选择第 2 层，还可以让嵌入表预取与第 1 层计算重叠</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8e504416" id="u8e504416" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793525988932-5781fda2-6e56-4468-a099-cde2bf8e2947.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uce3983c8-9d5f-4946-9019-580f5b57cc9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u560f831e-ff56-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A886%2C%22height%22%3A221%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A176335%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1326%2C%22originHeight%22%3A331%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22MIMLU-PROSUPERGPQA%22%2C%22x%22%3A339%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%22width%22%3A257%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AYERINDEX%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%